WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:03.930
The workday ends. Your customers don't.

2
00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:07.790
A new request arrives while your team is away.

3
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.320
The inquiry enters one connected workflow.

4
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:14.750
AI organizes the details for review.

5
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.380
The right record reaches the right place.

6
00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.980
Available times are offered. People retain control.

7
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:27.340
A customer chooses. The team receives confirmation.

8
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:31.600
One connected process. More time for real work.

